    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Nugent Auctioneers, 045 865 555, www.nugents.ie are delighted to present number 38 Woodleigh Way to the market, a spacious duplex apartment conveniently located in the Woodleigh Development. Ground floor accommodation consists of an entrance hall, master bedroom with ensuite off, two further bedrooms and family bathroom. The first floor features a large light filled open plan sitting room/ kitchen with sliding doors to the rear private balcony area, perfect for enjoying the long summer evenings. No. 38 presents a perfect opportunity for first time-buyers, investors or those seeking to downsize while remaining close to Blessington Village. \r\n\r\nThe home is ideally positioned facing onto a large communal area with ample parking adjacent, the Woodleigh estate is perfectly located just off the N81 Road ideal for commuting. The property is just 600m from the Aldi supermarket and a short stroll to Blessington Main Street providing many local amenities such as schools, restaurants, pubs, shops, sporting and recreational facilities."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hallway\t        \r\n7.02m x 1.96m\t\tTiled floor, under stairs storage, built in storage\r\nBedroom 1\t\r\n4.70m x 2.43m\t\tCarpet, wardrobe, ensuite off\r\nEnsuite\t\t\r\n2.44m x 1.02m\t\tFully tiled, shower cubicle, W.C & W.H.B \r\nBedroom 2\t\r\n3.60m x 2.38m\t\tWooden floor, wardrobe \r\nBedroom 3\t\r\n3.21m x 2.81m\t\tCarpet \r\nBathroom\t\r\n2.82m x 1.43m\t\tFully tiled, Bath, W.C & W.H.B \r\nKitchen\t\t\r\n4.88m x 3.69m\t\tTiled floor, downlights, upgraded kitchen \r\nLiving Area\t\r\n8.70m x 4.89m\t\tGas Fireplace, tiled floor, door to balcony off"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "● BER: B3 ● c. 95 mtr sq. | c. 1022 sq. ft ● Built in 2003 ● Ample Parking ● Private Rear Balcony ● High Quality Doors Throughout ● Open Plan Living Room / Kitchen ● Communal Green Areas ● Own Door Duplex Apartment ● 650m From N81 Road ● 1.2km from Main Street Blessington ● 13.6km from Naas ● 19km from M50 ● 19km from Citywest"
      },
